    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]REGIMENTAL COMMAND - CHINOOK 91 GSO STATION[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Operational Objectives - Kutjevo Refinery AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-AQ"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"You are ordered to deploy to Kutjevo Refinery, a Weston-Yamada-owned water purification and bottling facility located on the desert world of Dykuma I."}

    {"A full loss of contact occurred 36 hours ago."}

    {"The refinery serves as the lifeline for over two thousand residents and hosts the only potable water export operation in the region."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Establish a Forward Operating Base adjacent to the water extraction pipeline and purification nexus."}
    {"[bullet]Recover civilian personnel or refinery workers sheltering near the primary reservoir control deck or filtration chambers."}
    {"[bullet]Secure refinery data servers and shipment logs from central administration."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Restore environmental systems to avoid aquifer contamination."}
    {"[bullet]Sweep sublevel maintenance shafts and water tunnels for signs of xenoform activity."}
    {"[bullet]Avoid disruption of filtration processes unless tactically necessary."}

    {"Local wildlife may become hostile due to aquifer disruption."}
    {"[underline]Proceed with caution in subterranean zones.[/underline]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Second Lieutenant Lucas Harlan[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]Strategic Liaison Officer | 2nd Battalion, 3rd Regiment - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]For the Corps.[/italic][/color]"}

    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
