    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]SECTOR ENFORCEMENT CENTER - FORT THUNDER, TRAPPIST-5[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Engagement Protocol - Kutjevo Refinery AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-SE"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"Kutjevo isn't just a bottling plant. It is a monopoly on Dykuma I's aquifers."}

    {"If biological contamination spreads through the water system, it could threaten the entire biosphere and spark large-scale ecological collapse."}

    {"You are tasked with rapid containment and infrastructure denial."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Fortify a FOB positioned to defend access to central filtration shafts."}
    {"[bullet]Eliminate all unauthorized biological activity from aquifer intake tunnels and sublevel caverns."}
    {"[bullet]Shut down or secure all refinery systems to prevent external contamination or misuse."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Neutralize any hostile survivors attempting to sabotage or hijack Weston-Yamada shipment equipment."}
    {"[bullet]Destroy wildlife showing signs of unusual or unnatural mutation near the water reservoir."}
    {"[bullet]Collapse compromised tunnel systems if large-scale nesting structures are detected near deepwater zones."}

    {"This is not an asset. It's a vector for invasion."}
    {"Lock it down. Burn what you can't save."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Colonel Margaret A.W. Shanks[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]United Nations Marine Corps | Colonial Protection Organization - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]No mercy. No doubt.[/italic][/color]"}

    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
