    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]PROVOST MARSHAL'S FIELD OFFICE - NEW MASON COLONY, 61 CYGNI SYSTEM[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Deployment Priorities - Kutjevo Refinery AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-HM"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"Kutjevo's people rely on the aquifer not just for survival, but for hope."}

    {"Whatever threat has befallen the refinery, our mission must center on protecting the 2,000 workers and preserving the natural balance of this fragile desert world."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Establish a non-disruptive FOB at near the botanical block and medical suite."}
    {"[bullet]Locate and rescue non-combatant refinery personnel sheltering in administration or safety control stations."}
    {"[bullet]Preserve environmental monitoring and water flow systems from deliberate or accidental damage."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Use nonlethal deterrents where possible in case of worker unrest or confusion."}
    {"[bullet]Prevent aquifer runoff into structurally compromised tunnels or unknown subterranean spaces."}
    {"[bullet]Coordinate evac efforts through Weston-Yamada's shuttlepad access corridor."}

    {"Remember: this is their home, their water, and their lives."}
    {"Treat the terrain and its people with care."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Colonel Adrian Blackburn[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]UNMC Provost Marshal | Hearts & Minds Movement - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]In service to justice and peace.[/italic][/color]"}

