    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]TECHNICAL OPERATIONS DIRECTORATE - ANVIL STATION, HERCULINA ORBIT[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Research-Oriented Objectives - Kutjevo Refinery AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-RI"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"Preliminary data suggests Kutjevo's aquifer system may have undergone rapid biological shifts following the blackout."}

    {"You are to conduct a recovery operation for both biological and hydrological data."}

    {"Avoid ecological collapse. Do not contaminate the aquifer."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Establish a FOB to enable secure ingress to testing stations and storage silos."}
    {"[bullet]Collect tissue and water samples from areas showing unusual biological interaction with the ecosystem."}
    {"[bullet]Recover mineral filtration logs, biotech experiments, and aquifer microbiome studies from Weston-Yamada archives."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Deploy remotely operated equipment to sub-aquifer vents to investigate any signs of large-scale biological clustering."}
    {"[bullet]Extract contaminated water samples before purification occurs."}
    {"[bullet]Capture wild fauna showing behavioral anomalies for xenogenetic analysis."}

    {"This may be the first large-scale ecosystem showing signs of exposure to unknown biohazard agents that we've discovered."}
    {"[underline]Document everything.[/underline]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Lt. Colonel Geoffrey Lamdem[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]Division Logistics Commander | Military Organization for Development and Innovation - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]Onward through progress.[/italic][/color]"}

